  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"site-content\" id=\"content\">\n<div class=\"page-header flex-middle\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"inner flex-middle\">\n<h1 class=\"page-title\">FAQs</h1>\n<ul class=\"breadcrumbs none-style\" id=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<li><a href=\"./\">Home</a></li>\n<li class=\"active\">Frequently Asked Questions</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"faq\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 text-center\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span>// FAQ</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading\">Frequently Asked <br/>Questions</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-25\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n<div class=\"ot-accordions\">\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">How can AJNETWORKS help with my digital transformation?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        We provide comprehensive technology strategy and digital transformation services, helping you leverage modern tools and methodologies to streamline operations and enhance customer experience.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">What software engineering services do you offer?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        Our team specializes in full-stack web and mobile development, custom API integrations, and cloud-native solutions tailored to your specific business requirements.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">How do you ensure the security of our IT infrastructure?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        We implement multi-layered security protocols, including regular vulnerability assessments, robust firewall management, and employee training programs to safeguard your critical data and infrastructure.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">Do you provide ongoing support after project completion?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        Yes, we offer flexible post-delivery support and maintenance packages to ensure your systems remain secure, up-to-date, and performant as your business grows.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">Can you assist with optimizing our website performance?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        Absolutely. Our SEO and performance optimization services focus on technical audits, keyword strategy, and on-page enhancements to improve your visibility and drive organic traffic.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n<div class=\"ot-accordions\">\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">What is your approach to network design?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        We design scalable and secure network architectures, ranging from local office setups to complex enterprise infrastructures, focusing on reliability, speed, and future-proof connectivity.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">How do you handle data privacy and compliance?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        We strictly adhere to data protection regulations and best practices, ensuring that all solutions we build and manage prioritize user privacy and meet industry-specific compliance standards.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">What industries does AJNETWORKS typically serve?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        While we have deep expertise in finance, logistics, and retail, our adaptable technology solutions are designed to provide value across various sectors seeking digital growth.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">How long does a typical software project take?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        Project timelines vary based on complexity and scope. We use agile methodologies to ensure transparent communication and regular delivery of functional milestones throughout the lifecycle.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"acc-item\">\n<span class=\"acc-toggle\">How can I get a quote for my project?\n                      <i class=\"down flaticon-download-arrow\"></i><i class=\"up flaticon-up-arrow\"></i>\n</span>\n<div class=\"acc-content\">\n<p>\n                        You can request a free quote by filling out our contact form or reaching out to us directly via phone or email. Our team will schedule a consultation to discuss your needs.\n                      </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"faq-support\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12\">\n<div class=\"cta-faq\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-8 mb-4 mb-md-0\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span>// your challenge, our expertise</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading\">Ready to align technology with your business goals?</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 align-self-end\">\n<div class=\"ot-button text-center text-md-right\">\n<a class=\"octf-btn octf-btn-primary\" href=\"/book-consultation\" title=\"Right Arrow 1\">Book Advisory Call</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-120\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 text-center\">\n<div class=\"ot-heading\">\n<span>// support center</span>\n<h2 class=\"main-heading\">\n                    Our Support Team <br/>will Always Assist You 24/7\n                  </h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-35\"></div>\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4 mb-lg-0\">\n<div class=\"support-box\">\n<div class=\"inner-box\">\n<div class=\"overlay flex-middle\">\n<span class=\"number-box\">01</span>\n<div class=\"inner\">\n<p>\n                          Collaborate with AJNETWORKS to deliver innovative technology solutions to your client's, leveraging our technical expertise and project management resources.\n                        </p>\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/services\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<span class=\"number-box\">01</span>\n<h3>For Partners</h3>\n<img alt=\"For Partners\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/support1.webp\" width=\"750\" height=\"588\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4 mb-lg-0\">\n<div class=\"support-box\">\n<div class=\"inner-box\">\n<div class=\"overlay flex-middle\">\n<span class=\"number-box\">02</span>\n<div class=\"inner\">\n<p>\n                          Experience reliable and efficient technology services tailored to your specific needs, focusing on high-quality delivery and exceptional support.\n                        </p>\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<span class=\"number-box\">02</span>\n<h3>For Customers</h3>\n<img alt=\"For Customers\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/support2.webp\" width=\"750\" height=\"588\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12 mb-4 mb-lg-0\">\n<div class=\"support-box\">\n<div class=\"inner-box\">\n<div class=\"overlay flex-middle\">\n<span class=\"number-box\">03</span>\n<div class=\"inner\">\n<p>\n                          Accelerate your growth with our agile development services, designed to help fledgling businesses build and scale their MVP quickly and efficiently.\n                        </p>\n<a class=\"btn-details\" href=\"/services/software-engineering\"><i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow-1\"></i> LEARN MORE</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"content-box\">\n<span class=\"number-box\">03</span>\n<h3>For Startups</h3>\n<img alt=\"For Startups\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/support3.webp\" width=\"750\" height=\"588\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-120\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"trust-strip\" style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<div class=\"trust-logos\">\n<a aria-label=\"Rotaract Club of Nyali\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://rotaractnyali.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Rotaract Club of Nyali\" class=\"logo-wide\" height=\"44\" src=\"/images/client-logos/rotaract-nyali.webp\" width=\"160\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Bada Language Institute\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://www.badaglobal-bli.com/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Bada Language Institute\" height=\"44\" src=\"/images/client-logos/bli-global.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Siri Guru Singh Sabha Mombasa\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://www.sgssmombasa.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Siri Guru Singh Sabha Mombasa\" class=\"logo-tall\" height=\"48\" src=\"/images/client-logos/sgss-mombasa.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"SGSS Mombasa Medical Fund\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"https://medical.sgssmombasa.org/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"SGSS Medical Fund\" class=\"logo-tall\" height=\"48\" src=\"/images/client-logos/sgss-medical-fund.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Visa Portal Solutions\" class=\"trust-logo-item\" href=\"/client-success\">\n<img alt=\"Visa Portal Solutions\" height=\"44\" src=\"/images/client-logos/visa-portal-solutions.webp\" width=\"140\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>",
